s up a background (this one used photo paper - on a big roll). There is a table of props - they used boas, hats, stick-on mustaches, etc. People grab probs and have their pictures taken - couples, groups, etc. \n \n Now I&#039;m torn - do I use this idea and NOT put cameras on the table. I think table cameras might be too much and might end up costing more than the photo booth. Thoughts?","Attachments":[],"Id":844862,"PostDate":1253040587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I was at a wedding this weekend and am totally stealing a great idea they had. <br \/> <br \/> Somewhere in the room the photographer sets up a background (this one used photo paper - on a big roll). There is a table of props - they used boas, hats, stick-on mustaches, etc. People grab probs and have their pictures taken - couples, groups, etc. <br \/> <br \/> Now I'm torn - do I use this idea and NOT put cameras on the table. I think table cameras might be too much and might end up costing more than the photo booth. Thoughts?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristaheer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1237220721,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215852.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krista_H","Id":215852,"Name":"Krista_H","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d8c7fd69478df9f2c051e98fab4e10b","RawContent":"We set up our own photo booth. All you need is a tripod, a camera with a remote and a way to make sure that people don&#039;t move the camera. \n \n I like these high quality photos much better than the table cameras, and yes, they are much cheaper. I&#039;ll post a link to our photobooth pictures when I get home tonight.","Attachments":[],"Id":845105,"PostDate":1253048467,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We set up our own photo booth. All you need is a tripod, a camera with a remote and a way to make sure that people don't move the camera. <br \/> <br \/> I like these high quality photos much better than the table cameras, and yes, they are much cheaper. I'll post a link to our photobooth pictures when I get home tonight.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My Wedding Review<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/malisas-tulum-review-feb-2009-a-41016\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...-2009-a-41016\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"malisa_evans@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1236239687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215502.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Destination Scout","Id":215502,"Name":"Destination Scout","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e3d6f07b8694e428a89f952fd931f78","RawContent":"we are having an ahr with photographer and she is going to do the usual family friends shots then do the photo booth thing with props.did the guests enjoy it?","Attachments":[],"Id":845169,"PostDate":1253050784,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we are having an ahr with photographer and she is going to do the usual family friends shots then do the photo booth thing with props.did the guests enjoy it?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i877.photobucket.com\/albums\/ab335\/shellk\/DSC_7615_036.jpg\">http:\/\/i877.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...C_7615_036.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jshell@ntlworld.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1238413009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216283.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shellk","Id":216283,"Name":"shellk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ceb6af27bbc08fe2d76c405c57ce778d","RawContent":"Yes it was a lot of fun. Once they got into it the pictures got fun and crazy.","Attachments":[],"Id":845224,"PostDate":1253052024,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes it was a lot of fun. Once they got into it the pictures got fun and crazy.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristaheer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1237220721,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215852.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krista_H","Id":215852,"Name":"Krista_H","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1750722e5e94768040be651fcd4a8dc1","RawContent":"I&#039;ve seen LOTS of photo booths at weddings and I absolutely love them! I agree, you probably won&#039;t need the table cameras AND the photo booth, so I&#039;d stick with just one or the other if I were you.","Attachments":[],"Id":846212,"PostDate":1253083599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've seen LOTS of photo booths at weddings and I absolutely love them! I agree, you probably won't need the table cameras AND the photo booth, so I'd stick with just one or the other if I were you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.whenismywedding.com\/signature\/f955f6eb25b5943c.gif\">http:\/\/www.whenismywedding.com\/signa...eb25b5943c.gif<\/a><br><span>Please vote for me at <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingbells.ca\/bloggersearch\">www.weddingbells.ca\/bloggersearch<\/a><span>! Thanks!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lara.varona@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249504244,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220216.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lara","Id":220216,"Name":"Lara","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42e538da060337f64a9496acbfaad3d5","RawContent":"Hmmm....I thought we had more of our photobooth pictures on flickr. Here are a few.\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/toddneville\/page2\/\"&gt;Flickr: toddneville&#039;s Photostream&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":846274,"PostDate":1253085927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hmmm....I thought we had more of our photobooth pictures on flickr. Here are a few.<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/toddneville\/page2\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Flickr: toddneville's Photostream<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My Wedding Review<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/malisas-tulum-review-feb-2009-a-41016\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...-2009-a-41016\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"malisa_evans@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1236239687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215502.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Destination Scout","Id":215502,"Name":"Destination Scout","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e44ca93ef0a50a818d51560d68f49d4","RawContent":"I LOVE the photobooth idea. I&#039;m personally not a fan of the cameras on the tables. From what I&#039;ve experienced in the past (from my brothers and sisters weddings) the majority of those pictures were usually junk. I think you&#039;d get way better pictures with the photobooth. That&#039;s just my opinion. Good luck","Attachments":[],"Id":846275,"PostDate":1253085996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I LOVE the photobooth idea. I'm personally not a fan of the cameras on the tables. From what I've experienced in the past (from my brothers and sisters weddings) the majority of those pictures were usually junk. I think you'd get way better pictures with the photobooth. That's just my opinion. Good luck\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"knickless1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247545720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219395.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Taylorbride","Id":219395,"Name":"Taylorbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f4ed60e278a093891a74062859dd490","RawContent":"here are some photographers that have great photobooth inspiration\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.theblogisfound.com\/index.cfm?catID=16\"&gt;the image is found . photo blog&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I have never seen the table cameras work out nicely. Most people have a point &amp;amp; shoot digital camera with them anyway. You usually just end up with rolls &amp;amp; rolls of bad pictures espcially if it&#039;s dark. I just got the digital files from all of our guests. Some people mailed me a disc, some uploaded them &amp;amp; other I burnt copies of while home.","Attachments":[],"Id":846278,"PostDate":1253086238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                here are some photographers that have great photobooth inspiration<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.theblogisfound.com\/index.cfm?catID=16' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>the image is found . photo blog<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I have never seen the table cameras work out nicely. Most people have a point & shoot digital camera with them anyway. You usually just end up with rolls & rolls of bad pictures espcially if it's dark. I just got the digital files from all of our guests. Some people mailed me a disc, some uploaded them & other I burnt copies of while home.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182664980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfd8d20da804ef729aeb716cdada4867","RawContent":"a photobooth might be hard to do for a DW. The set up would be a lot to fly with. \n \n I&#039;ve seen other cute things like a photo guest book. I can&#039;t remember who posted it, but their photographer took pictures of guests holding up a marker board with something they wrote on it.","Attachments":[],"Id":846280,"PostDate":1253086364,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                a photobooth might be hard to do for a DW. The set up would be a lot to fly with. <br \/> <br \/> I've seen other cute things like a photo guest book. I can't remember who posted it, but their photographer took pictures of guests holding up a marker board with something they wrote on it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182664980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42506,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6101957bf6cb971d696b8359170d6941","RawContent":"i love the idea of a photo booth over cameras on the table. just seems more fun. in my experience with the camera at the table...one person gets a hold of it and wastes all the film.","Attachments":[],"Id":846405,"PostDate":1253101314,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i love the idea of a photo booth over cameras on the table. just seems more fun. in my experience with the camera at the table...one person gets a hold of it and wastes all the film.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i620.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt288\/wendals\/wedding\/IMG_6421PoolParty1-resized.jpg\">http:\/\/i620.photobucket.com\/albums\/t...y1-resized.jpg<\/a><br><i>photo by nora bohanon<\/i><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.norasweddingblog.com\/?p=1607\">http:\/\/www.norasweddingblog.com\/?p=1607<\/a><br><br><span>my GBP wedding review!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/midnight24-gran-bahia-principe-coba-tulum-wedding-fri-april-23-2010-pics-links-59687\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...s-links-59687\/<\/a><span>we've been blogged!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/destinationinspirations.com\/?p=1507\">http:\/\/destinationinspirations.com\/?p=1507<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"wendals24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1236075577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215437.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"midnight24","Id":215437,"Name":"midnight24","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"42506","Title":"Photo Booth","LastPostDate":1448866656},"Pages":{"TotalItems":23,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
