an&#039;t find any contact number or website online and wondering how to book them? Also does anyone know of a local DJ who is good in case we go that route instead? Thanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1007860,"PostDate":1264242249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, I am trying to decide what to do about reception music for my Provo wedding... does anyone have any info about Island Boys? I can't find any contact number or website online and wondering how to book them? Also does anyone know of a local DJ who is good in case we go that route instead? Thanks so much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anne_zink@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264208497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224959.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PandaNYC","Id":224959,"Name":"PandaNYC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8679613dfbd5686a3c040c845327be64","RawContent":"Hi, I am at home right now and don&#039;t have info in front of me. If you want to email &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:Ileana@tropicalimaging.com\"&gt;Ileana@tropicalimaging.com&lt;\/a&gt;, I know she can give you a run down of music options available and how to get in touch(and I am sure she&#039;ll give you an opinion on what we see works for what you are looking for. ) There aren&#039;t a ton of options on island available but most are distinctly different in style and music, so she can maybe direct you to someone who works for you. \n \n Just give her a quick email, She won&#039;t be in the office tomorrow but will be in on Monday (tell her Krys gave you the contact info from BDW).\n \n Krys","Attachments":[],"Id":1008348,"PostDate":1264308818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, I am at home right now and don't have info in front of me. If you want to email <a href='mailto:Ileana@tropicalimaging.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Ileana@tropicalimaging.com<\/a>, I know she can give you a run down of music options available and how to get in touch(and I am sure she'll give you an opinion on what we see works for what you are looking for. ) There aren't a ton of options on island available but most are distinctly different in style and music, so she can maybe direct you to someone who works for you. <br \/> <br \/> Just give her a quick email, She won't be in the office tomorrow but will be in on Monday (tell her Krys gave you the contact info from BDW).<br \/> <br \/> Krys\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmann@tciway.tc","IpAddress":"65.255.54.194","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1213296967,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209917.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tropical Imaging","Id":209917,"Name":"Tropical Imaging","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16c32e8bffbf748c6f9ebfe99fbed600","RawContent":"Hi there! I am also getting married in Turks &amp;amp; Caicos and we are in the process of choosing either a band or DJ for our small reception dinner. My wedding planner did let me know that most bands are around $500\/hr and a great is DJ is about $200\/hr.\n \n I will let you know what else I find out!","Attachments":[],"Id":1026044,"PostDate":1265605306,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi there! I am also getting married in Turks & Caicos and we are in the process of choosing either a band or DJ for our small reception dinner. My wedding planner did let me know that most bands are around $500\/hr and a great is DJ is about $200\/hr.<br \/> <br \/> I will let you know what else I find out!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gwyndoleneharrison@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1244749181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218355.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bronze8584","Id":218355,"Name":"Bronze8584","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edf06772092cedb16aba7078dab549c5","RawContent":"Just had wedding in Turks. We used DJ called Subtronic Sound. He was pretty good.\n \n Would not recommend ISLAND HARMONY wedding planner. We had a terrible experience with her.","Attachments":[],"Id":1064790,"PostDate":1267944907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just had wedding in Turks. We used DJ called Subtronic Sound. He was pretty good.<br \/> <br \/> Would not recommend ISLAND HARMONY wedding planner. We had a terrible experience with her.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Shrinknina@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1267756390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226164.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mercedesbenz","Id":226164,"Name":"mercedesbenz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77d8b272356525b1fab25c2fd24e1a4e","RawContent":"Panda have you had your wedding yet and who did you go with for entertainment\/music at your wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":1083498,"PostDate":1269145526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Panda have you had your wedding yet and who did you go with for entertainment\/music at your wedding?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263768922,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68c7cbad9516dde8093cc4bacb437caa","RawContent":"Hey Panda, can you tell me who you decided to go with for the music for your reception? And what your general thoughts were on the service they provided.\n \n Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1083500,"PostDate":1269145894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Panda, can you tell me who you decided to go with for the music for your reception? And what your general thoughts were on the service they provided.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263768922,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76fe27a41ae13986953bf3f1fe817845","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m resurrecting this thread in the hopes that someone will offer recent reviews of T&amp;amp;C DJs.&amp;nbsp; Any thoughts?&amp;nbsp; Recommendations?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m hoping for someone that will hopefully stick to the list of songs we provide...or even just play from our ipod (i.e. no chicken dance).   Not looking for island music.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you in advance, ladies!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1482556,"PostDate":1310061054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm resurrecting this thread in the hopes that someone will offer recent reviews of T&C DJs.\u00a0 Any thoughts?\u00a0 Recommendations?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm hoping for someone that will hopefully stick to the list of songs we provide...or even just play from our ipod (i.e. no chicken dance).\u00a0\u00a0 Not looking for island music.<\/p> <p> Thank you in advance, ladies!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loren.kokal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1301933625,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238512.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":154,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kokalloa","Id":238512,"Name":"kokalloa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce97d40a7d086f37d830ad3aa42036a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We got married in March and used DJ William from subtronic sound.&amp;nbsp; He was GREAT.&amp;nbsp; We provided a list of songs (8 hours worth)&amp;nbsp;for him to play, and he stuck to it, but played what he thought was good depending on the time of night.&amp;nbsp; We highly recommend him!&amp;nbsp; We didn&#039;t have him scheduled for our after party, but he offered to DJ there too (which we did).&amp;nbsp; We got so many compliments on what a great job he did!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1483341,"PostDate":1310158854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We got married in March and used DJ William from subtronic sound.\u00a0 He was GREAT.\u00a0 We provided a list of songs (8 hours worth)\u00a0for him to play, and he stuck to it, but played what he thought was good depending on the time of night.\u00a0 We highly recommend him!\u00a0 We didn't have him scheduled for our after party, but he offered to DJ there too (which we did).\u00a0 We got so many compliments on what a great job he did!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmredmond1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1277612492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229600.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon-to-be-Mrs.D","Id":229600,"Name":"Soon-to-be-Mrs.D","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b8c369d34579d10c4b590387b48990b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That helps - thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1484246,"PostDate":1310393859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That helps - thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loren.kokal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1301933625,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238512.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":154,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kokalloa","Id":238512,"Name":"kokalloa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":47477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99fd615f8ee7201ca56f804f29afad0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Bronze...so what band did you use for $500\/hr and DJ for $200\/hr? Planning a wedding in September and getting ridiculous price quotes.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1506764,"PostDate":1313679375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Bronze...so what band did you use for $500\/hr and DJ for $200\/hr? Planning a wedding in September and getting ridiculous price quotes.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millie@etcagent.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1313679175,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244074.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ETC Planner","Id":244074,"Name":"ETC Planner","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"47477","Title":"Seeking Band\/DJ for Turks & Caicos (Island Boys?)","LastPostDate":1414683153},"Pages":{"TotalItems":31,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
