of you have any questions about Bermuda I&#039;m happy to help! Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847101,"PostDate":1398720110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all potential Bermuda destination wedding brides! I actually live in Bermuda so any of you have any questions about Bermuda I'm happy to help! Cheers!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sd237005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395508893,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277286.jpg?_r=1401563994","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BDABeachBum","Id":277286,"Name":"BDABeachBum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76954,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bf2d03b6832a6c9cf71750dbc357b27","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BDABeachBum\" post=\"1847101\" timestamp=\"1398720110\"]\nHello all potential Bermuda destination wedding brides! I actually live in Bermuda so any of you have any questions about Bermuda I&#039;m happy to help! Cheers![\/quote]How amazingly nice of you!! I am planning a Bermuda wedding now. I&#039;m between The Reefs resort (Caso&#039;s Point) or stonehole bay for the ceremony. From a locals perspective, which would you suggest? I&#039;m coming into the dockyard by cruise so looking to stay near that end of the island.\n\nThanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1874409,"PostDate":1412570873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BDABeachBum, on 28 April 2014 - 01:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello all potential Bermuda destination wedding brides! I actually live in Bermuda so any of you have any questions about Bermuda I'm happy to help! Cheers!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHow amazingly nice of you!! I am planning a Bermuda wedding now. I'm between The Reefs resort (Caso's Point) or stonehole bay for the ceremony. From a locals perspective, which would you suggest? I'm coming into the dockyard by cruise so looking to stay near that end of the island.<br><br>\nThanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cathyr99@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1412566251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280304.jpg?_r=1412569727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"palmtree99","Id":280304,"Name":"palmtree99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.207.208.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76954,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"