 find out who the best DJ on the island is that people might be able to recommend. We&#039;re all about top 40 hits, mix of hiphop, pop, club music that will get people DANCING. Thinking along the lines of Black Eyed Peas, Rihanna, Nikki Minaj, Pitbull, etc. We will have a relatively large party around 80ish people and mostly in their late 20s, very early 30s.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Our planner recommended DJ Dayoh, DJ William John, DJ Viper, DJ Cliff...but it seems that DJ Dayoh is the only DJ with a website.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Any thoughts will be appreciated, thank you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1812778,"PostDate":1383841275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p> <p>We are getting married at T&C next summer and looking to find out who the best DJ on the island is that people might be able to recommend. We're all about top 40 hits, mix of hiphop, pop, club music that will get people DANCING. Thinking along the lines of Black Eyed Peas, Rihanna, Nikki Minaj, Pitbull, etc. We will have a relatively large party around 80ish people and mostly in their late 20s, very early 30s.\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Our planner recommended DJ Dayoh, DJ William John, DJ Viper, DJ Cliff...but it seems that DJ Dayoh is the only DJ with a website.\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Any thoughts will be appreciated, thank you!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stellascottwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupNa