> Time: 1449968417 / Sun, 13 Dec 2015 01:00:17 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=63252&start=20&SessionId=a06e414b71f7e43becd9e06efc1f4c51
> User JennKirk11 (285578)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8a8f1a29a5ca6cc17c79618b19fe878","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on your wedding! I got married at the Seven Stars last April and used bougainvillea for my bouquet, corsages, boutonnieres and my centerpieces. I also got them through my package, so it&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;Niki\/the hotel that&amp;nbsp;made arrangements with the florist.&amp;nbsp;I had no problems with anything drooping or wilting, especially the bouquet. The hotel kept&amp;nbsp;the bouquet&amp;nbsp;in the fridge in my room right up until I needed it. And then the whole ceremony and pictures only takes about an hour anyway and then you&#039;re basically done with your bouquet. But I also didn&#039;t notice any issues with my centerpieces either. If I had any issue, the groom&#039;s boutonniere got a little mushed, but I think was mostly from hugs after the ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was more concerned that the&amp;nbsp;flowers wouldn&#039;t look all that special in arrangements but I couldn&#039;t fathom paying to ship flowers in (which is the only other option). Turns out, I absolutely loved my arrangements - bright pop of color, island-y, not too &#039;done&#039; or formal, but very pretty&amp;nbsp;for my beach wedding.&amp;nbsp;Hope my two cents helps!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1574362,"PostDate":1327705310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on your wedding! I got married at the Seven Stars last April and used bougainvillea for my bouquet, corsages, boutonnieres and my centerpieces. I also got them through my package, so it\u00a0was\u00a0Niki\/the hotel that\u00a0made arrangements with the florist.\u00a0I had no problems with anything drooping or wilting, especially the bouquet. The hotel kept\u00a0the bouquet\u00a0in the fridge in my room right up until I needed it. And then the whole ceremony and pictures only takes about an hour anyway and then you're basically done with your bouquet. But I also didn't notice any issues with my centerpieces either. If I had any issue, the groom's boutonniere got a little mushed, but I think was mostly from hugs after the ceremony.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was more concerned that the\u00a0flowers wouldn't look all that special in arrangements but I couldn't fathom paying to ship flowers in (which is the only other option). Turns out, I absolutely loved my arrangements - bright pop of color, island-y, not too 'done' or formal, but very pretty\u00a0for my beach wedding.\u00a0Hope my two cents helps!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandevillel@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1201409112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208377.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lm3682","Id":208377,"Name":"lm3682","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"184739f57bbc0797cf229036b53d8fbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; If you want to see photos of bougainvillea at a wedding for floral details here&#039;s a link to a wedding at the sands with boutonnieres and bouquets.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Krys&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/brilliant.tc\/blog\/2011\/12\/the-wedding-of-candice-and-david-at-the-sands-turks-and-caicos\/&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1574557,"PostDate":1327758493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> If you want to see photos of bougainvillea at a wedding for floral details here's a link to a wedding at the sands with boutonnieres and bouquets.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Krys<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/brilliant.tc\/blog\/2011\/12\/the-wedding-of-candice-and-david-at-the-sands-turks-and-caicos\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/brilliant.tc\/...rks-and-caicos\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmann@tciway.tc","IpAddress":"65.255.54.194","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1213296967,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209917.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tropical Imaging","Id":209917,"Name":"Tropical Imaging","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac1dde4ce4fa6ad86fee7effe09a2bf8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the reassurance, Krys!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; While looking at various pictures on Tropical Imaging&#039;s website, I have seen many beautiful bouquets and arrangements! I saw Candice and David&#039;s pictures too. Even though the bouganvillea look perfectly fine, I got a little stressed when I read several negative things about them on other sites.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I hope you don&#039;t mind! I have two other questions for you...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1. Are all of the bouganvillea in Turks and Caicos various shades of fuschia? Some of the pictures look a little purple-ish fuschia and others look like a vivid hot pink. I&#039;m trying to decide upon a color theme.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2. I&#039;m getting married in early December 2012. How is the humidity during the month of December? I&#039;ve already researched it, but I&#039;d love a local&#039;s opinion!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575724,"PostDate":1327965936,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the reassurance, Krys!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> While looking at various pictures on Tropical Imaging's website, I have seen many beautiful bouquets and arrangements! I saw Candice and David's pictures too. Even though the bouganvillea look perfectly fine, I got a little stressed when I read several negative things about them on other sites.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I hope you don't mind! I have two other questions for you...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1. Are all of the bouganvillea in Turks and Caicos various shades of fuschia? Some of the pictures look a little purple-ish fuschia and others look like a vivid hot pink. I'm trying to decide upon a color theme.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 2. I'm getting married in early December 2012. How is the humidity during the month of December? I've already researched it, but I'd love a local's opinion!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sconn1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1322685715,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248205.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sconn1","Id":248205,"Name":"sconn1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5088b20031195abeaad741754b18665","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Glad to help!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The most common color of Bougainvillea is bright fuschia with the deeper Purplish version probably the next most seen, (but not as common).&amp;nbsp; We also see a peachy\/coral one but those bushes aren&#039;t as lush and I have never seen it in a bouquet.   The one in the photo is the most used, and most abundant.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; December is a great time for outside temps.&amp;nbsp; Definitely not as humid, and a nice temperature during the day (low to mid 80&#039;s).   My mom doesn&#039;t do well in hot and humid temperatures (and we don&#039;t have a\/c at our house) and she comes for 3 weeks in December and loves the weather.  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Obviously we could get warm or cold fronts during that time and it may be hotter or cooler than normal, but December is when I put away tank tops and get the short sleeve shirts out as I am not sweating!!!&amp;nbsp; (and maybe a lightweight 3\/4 length sleeve in the evening for us locals, the tourists are still in full summer gear LOL)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope that helps.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Krys&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1576399,"PostDate":1328051780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Glad to help!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The most common color of Bougainvillea is bright fuschia with the deeper Purplish version probably the next most seen, (but not as common).\u00a0 We also see a peachy\/coral one but those bushes aren't as lush and I have never seen it in a bouquet.\u00a0\u00a0 The one in the photo is the most used, and most abundant.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> December is a great time for outside temps.\u00a0 Definitely not as humid, and a nice temperature during the day (low to mid 80's).\u00a0\u00a0 My mom doesn't do well in hot and humid temperatures (and we don't have a\/c at our house) and she comes for 3 weeks in December and loves the weather.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Obviously we could get warm or cold fronts during that time and it may be hotter or cooler than normal, but December is when I put away tank tops and get the short sleeve shirts out as I am not sweating!!!\u00a0 (and maybe a lightweight 3\/4 length sleeve in the evening for us locals, the tourists are still in full summer gear LOL)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope that helps.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Krys<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmann@tciway.tc","IpAddress":"65.255.54.194","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1213296967,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209917.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tropical Imaging","Id":209917,"Name":"Tropical Imaging","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb48cd919961ca0f7c4b556a54ef692e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you again, Krys! All of your countless posts have been TREMENDOUSLY helpful!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1577814,"PostDate":1328294532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you again, Krys! All of your countless posts have been TREMENDOUSLY helpful!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sconn1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1322685715,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248205.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sconn1","Id":248205,"Name":"sconn1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"284684c4e630c3eef74b105bfee5fce6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; You should consider a brand new location that was built for a King - literally! The Palazzo!! It&#039;s absolutely gorgeous and gives you the feeling of being in a private villa while at the same time enjoying the benefits of a resort! You can see a stunning video here:&amp;nbsp;http:\/\/vimeo.com\/36736495&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582188,"PostDate":1329190021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You should consider a brand new location that was built for a King - literally! The Palazzo!! It's absolutely gorgeous and gives you the feeling of being in a private villa while at the same time enjoying the benefits of a resort! You can see a stunning video here:\u00a0<iframe src=\"http:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/36736495\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Vassili.shields@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329189539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251384.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":85,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PalazzoTC","Id":251384,"Name":"PalazzoTC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb36b208508158626f31ae67c2eaec02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Just to let you know that I booked with Gansevoort!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1587503,"PostDate":1330360234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just to let you know that I booked with Gansevoort!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sara.song@aig.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309404768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241777.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sss39","Id":241777,"Name":"sss39","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcaadf7abb74b9f74c7574f9f7025ba5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I also went with Gansevoort! I had some issues with Seven Stars. &amp;nbsp;Dorell at Gansevoort provided me with the most outstanding service! &amp;nbsp;I felt way more comfortable with her and their resort! After a visit, I was convinced that this was the place for me! Can&#039;t wait!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1587609,"PostDate":1330371634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I also went with Gansevoort! I had some issues with Seven Stars. \u00a0Dorell at Gansevoort provided me with the most outstanding service! \u00a0I felt way more comfortable with her and their resort! After a visit, I was convinced that this was the place for me! Can't wait!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jboddie06@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1324945231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248936.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenaya","Id":248936,"Name":"jenaya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ae180c5d6c73c4f5da798b7c57077ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow TWO Gansevoort brides? I&#039;ve been having the hardest time finding anyone... when are your weddings? Mine is booked for August 10th. I haven&#039;t done a site visit, so I&#039;m just keeping my fingers crossed that it&#039;s everything I hope it will be.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also just booked Sheque Perfection for hair (want to do my own makeup) and looking to book Brilliant for my photography.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What size are your weddings? DETAILSS =)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Victoria&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1587682,"PostDate":1330379235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow TWO Gansevoort brides? I've been having the hardest time finding anyone... when are your weddings? Mine is booked for August 10th. I haven't done a site visit, so I'm just keeping my fingers crossed that it's everything I hope it will be.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also just booked Sheque Perfection for hair (want to do my own makeup) and looking to book Brilliant for my photography.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What size are your weddings? DETAILSS =)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Victoria<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoriagilchrist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1330111390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251882.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fadeintoyou","Id":251882,"Name":"fadeintoyou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63252,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6699ca0e0012f98fae7201aabfde71f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Quick question, I just looked at the Gansevoort for pricing on rooms. It said the most inexpensive room was $700\/night. Is that pretty accurate? I was looking for April 2013. It seems crazy that my guests would have to pay $3500 just for 5 nights of vacation. Are you all paying that or do they offer discounts for guests? I haven&#039;t looked too much into the cost yet, so I&#039;d be interested in any personal input! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1587806,"PostDate":1330390890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Quick question, I just looked at the Gansevoort for pricing on rooms. It said the most inexpensive room was $700\/night. Is that pretty accurate? I was looking for April 2013. It seems crazy that my guests would have to pay $3500 just for 5 nights of vacation. Are you all paying that or do they offer discounts for guests? I haven't looked too much into the cost yet, so I'd be interested in any personal input! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karahandy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317702663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246188.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KaraMae","Id":246188,"Name":"KaraMae","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":51,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
